    <string name="about_body">Afzal\'s Roza Alarm keeps your fasts on schedule — Ramadan, 9 and 10 Muharram, the White Days of every month, or any dates you pick off the calendar. Reminders arrive the evening before so Suhoor is never a rush.</string>

